# SeatSniper MVP Implementation Plan

## Executive Summary

This plan details the implementation of SeatSniper v1.0 MVP - a ticket intelligence platform that monitors StubHub and Ticketmaster for PNW events, calculates value scores, and delivers alerts via Telegram and SMS. The architecture follows established patterns from the eliza-starter and solana-trade-bot projects while introducing SeatSniper-specific Claude agents for development assistance.

---

