## Scoring Formula (1-100 scale)

Total Score = Weighted Sum of:
| Component | Weight | Description |
|-----------|--------|-------------|
| Price vs Average | 35% | How price compares to current market |
| Section Quality | 25% | Venue section tier (Premium to Obstructed) |
| Row Position | 15% | Front rows score higher |
| Historical Pricing | 15% | Price vs historical trends |
| Resale Potential | 10% | Demand + timing factors |

## Section Tier Mapping
- PREMIUM (1): Floor, VIP, Club
- UPPER_PREMIUM (2): Lower bowl center
- MID_TIER (3): Lower bowl sides, Upper center
- UPPER_LEVEL (4): Upper sides, balcony
- OBSTRUCTED (5): Limited view, behind stage

## Calibration Guidelines
- Score 85+: "Excellent" - Top 5% value
- Score 70-84: "Good" - Top 20% value  
- Score 55-69: "Fair" - Average value
- Score 40-54: "Below Average" - Wait for better
- Score <40: "Poor" - Overpriced
</Value_Score_Algorithm>

<Tuning_Protocol>
